        "question": "A router holds a static route 10.1.0.0/16 via R2 (AD 1), an OSPF route 10.1.4.0/24 via R3 (AD 110) and a RIP route 10.1.4.128/25 via R4 (AD 120). Where is a packet for 10.1.4.200 sent?",
